      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. It verifies that converting a `TaiInstant` to `UtcInstant` and then adding a negative duration of 1000 minutes both remain on Modified Julian Day 36203. I'll improve understandability by renaming variables, extracting a named constant, removing unused imports, and adding brief clarifying comments.The improved test compiled successfully."
